{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1117016-looking-for-a-denver-metro-area-group","id":1117016,"title":"Looking for a Denver Metro Area Group","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-16T17:28:39-07:00","id":1117016,"title":"Looking for a Denver Metro Area Group","content":"I apologize if this is the wrong forum to post this in, but I am looking for to put together a <i>Werewolf: the Forsaken</i> gaming group in the Denver Metro area. We'd play on Sunday afternoons and we'd provide dinner for everyone. I'll be the Storyteller, but that isn't necessarily a permanent thing as those duties (and the game being run for that matter) can shift around.<br /> <br /> So, anyone from the Denver Metro Area looking to play?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13210-fossmano1","name":"FossMaNo1","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-17T05:07:39-07:00","id":1117150,"title":"","content":"Sorry, not from the area. You might try <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings\">this part of the forum</a><br /> .<br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/forumdisplay.php?21-Ye-Olde-Tavern-Looking-for-Group\" target=\"_blank\">And this one</a>, in RPG.net.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":".  Prettied it up 07-17-2017, 08:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-17T05:16:06-07:00","id":1117153,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FossMaNo1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1117016-looking-for-a-denver-metro-area-group#post1117016\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I apologize if this is the wrong forum to post this in, but I am looking for to put together a <i>Werewolf: the Forsaken</i> gaming group in the Denver Metro area. We'd play on Sunday afternoons and we'd provide dinner for everyone. I'll be the Storyteller, but that isn't necessarily a permanent thing as those duties (and the game being run for that matter) can shift around.<br /> <br /> So, anyone from the Denver Metro Area looking to play?</div> </div> </div> </div>I would be very interested, though I work until 5:00 on Sundays. It might be possible for me to change days but no guarantees.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-28T08:42:51-07:00","id":1134846,"title":"","content":"Hey there! I noticed this post last week and it took a while to get my account activated to reply.<br /> <br /> We are having a meetup to talk about starting a World of Darkness game this coming Sunday, the <b>3rd of September</b>. If you are interested in joining us as we decide when and what to play and who can make it, <b>email me at mrrmrenfield at gmail</b><br /> <br /> We will likely meet again after that sometime too, but no further plans have yet been made. You can follow the discussion on Meetup.com for <b>The Denver RPG Group</b><br /> <br /> Cheers!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15376-renleyrenfield","name":"RenleyRenfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15376_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}